  "prefLabel": "Ed 901.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 901.01 Purpose. The purpose of Ed 900 is to implement the provisions of RSA 189:59-63 relative to the department’s responsibility for administering the dropout prevention and dropout recovery program in order to assist pupils in successfully completing high school.\n\nSource. #8582, eff 3-15-06; ss by #10649, eff 7-26-14",
